cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite the manuscript below and this repository."
title: "Terrain-prior weakly supervised extraction of ancient mountain roads under closed canopy"
abstract: >-
  Dual-branch weakly supervised pipeline for extracting ancient mountain roads
  from airborne LiDAR under closed canopy: macro path finding with a
  directional-cosine terrain penalty, weakly supervised corridor segmentation,
  road-preserving ground filtering and adaptive-resolution DEM generation.
